{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02552","headline":"奉和七夕宴悬圃应制二首 二 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和七夕宴悬圃应制二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婺闺期今夕，娥轮泛浅潢。\n迎秋伴暮雨，待暝合神光。\n荐寝低云鬓，呈态解霓裳。\n喜中愁漏促，别後怨天长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}